 <div class="overlay" id="overlay"><section class="card"><div class="eyebrow">Moonlit rooftop · Kyoto</div><h1 id="headline">Dojo <span>Duel</span></h1><p class="intro" id="intro">A fast, focused one-on-one martial arts showdown. Outthink Rook, land clean strikes, and own the final round.</p><button class="cta" id="startButton">Enter the ring&nbsp; →</button><div class="keys"><span><i class="key">A</i><i class="key">D</i> Move</span><span><i class="key">W</i> Jump</span><span><i class="key">J</i> Punch</span><span><i class="key">K</i> Kick</span><span><i class="key">L</i> Guard</span></div></section></div>
 <div class="mobile-controls" aria-label="Touch controls"><div class="pad"><button class="control" data-key="left" aria-label="Move left">←</button><button class="control" data-key="right" aria-label="Move right">→</button></div><div class="action-pad"><button class="control" data-key="guard" aria-label="Guard">◒</button><button class="control action" data-key="punch" aria-label="Punch">J</button><button class="control kick" data-key="kick" aria-label="Kick">K</button><button class="control" data-key="jump" aria-label="Jump">↑</button></div></div>
 </main>
